      "created_at": "2016-02-12T16:27:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The few times I've lost to Blade, it's <em>always</em> because of Devious Disruption -- either because it hammered me, or it forced me to get rid of crucial ongoings and equipment and I couldn't recover in time.</p><p>Hate that card.</p>",
