      "username": "Reverend_Pete",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-12T16:48:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm sure you'll all be relieved to know that Blade did NOT prevail the fourth time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>TLT, grandpa Legacy, Omnitron X and Dark Visionary (I wasn't taking any chances) flattened Blade in the block.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Only Legacy took damage, and that was because he played Take Down twice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Whew! Now I can move on.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
